        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-MDS01, Madison Rope Door Pull Set with Ornate Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis stunningly designed Classic Madison Back-to-Back Door Pull combines the traditional beauty of a rope handle with decorative, oversized finials. The Madison Classic Door Pull Set can be used on either residential or commercial doors. It comes packaged with 2 pulls and the hardware needed to back-to-back mount them--pulls attach to each other through the door--including a pair of lock-down rosettes (not pictured).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. Also available: Individual <a href=\"/products/classic-madison-door-pull-first-impressions-mds01\"><b>First Impressions Model MDS01</b></a> for one side of a door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Madison Series 1 Pair or Pulls:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-MDS01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262301\"><b>First Impressions PR-MDS01 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-PR-MDS01026:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 26\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 4.21\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.54\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PR-MDS01030:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 4.21\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.54\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impressions door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including different center to center mounting distances and  <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Classic Madison Back-to-Back Door Pull",
                "description": "This stunningly designed Classic Madison Back-to-Back Door Pull combines the traditional beauty of a rope handle with decorative, oversized finials. The Madison Classic Door Pull Set can be used on either residential or commercial doors. It comes packaged with 2 pulls and the hardware needed to back-to-back mount them--pulls attach to each other through the door--including a pair of lock-down rosettes.\r\n",
